  "body": "_IFD0:ModifyDate_ might or might not be a good candidate for a place, that tells, when a version of a photo has actually been exported. Some raw editors are using it, some not.\n\nWhen editing metadata, digiKam, for instance, creates a timestamp in a dedicated place - _XMP-digiKam:CaptionsDateTimeStamps_ -, that shows, when metadata has been fiddled with.\n\nThe file timestamp is difficult to keep unchanged for many different reasons.\n\nIf you do not find this \"issue\" relevant, please, close it and do relevant things, I am glad I can use this fine program, getting constantly better. Good luck an be well!\n\n(edit: I have been allowed to close it myself)",
